type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...みなさんにとって\n素敵な一年になりますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年もよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}